"""Daemon-owned P5 alpha execution layer.

Only proposal identifiers cross the public command boundary.  Scientific
observations, labels, candidate diagnostics, and result bytes stay inside the
research-writer trust domain; callers receive status, opaque IDs and hashes.
"""
